   114	onboarded-but-stale / not-graphed = legacy). Surface on the Agent → Channels/Reach tab: card
   115	audience row (avatar stack + "N can recall" + gated/agent-only/not-synced chip) + detail panel
   116	(Enforcement segment + "Who can recall" list with you / linked-Slack / Slack-member pills + DM
   117	deep links). Slack is the source of truth; READ-ONLY. No MCP/publishing dependency.
   118	
   119	## Risks / dependencies
   120	
   121	- **Directory-publishing the Lobu Slack app** — hard gate for any live MCP use. Repo ships only a
